			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Replace log crate with dev_log macro for categorized logging\n\nReplace all instances of log::{info, debug, error, warn, trace} with the custom dev_log! macro across the Mountain codebase. The new macro accepts a category string as the first argument (e.g., dev_log!(\"lifecycle\", \"message\")) enabling better log filtering and analysis. Categories include: lifecycle, grpc, ipc, cocoon, extensions, config, model, storage, commands, output, terminal, and others.\n\nAdditional changes:\n- Fix node_modules path resolution in vscode-file scheme handler (Static/node_modules/ → Static/Application/node_modules/)\n- Add filesystem fallback for dev mode when assets aren't embedded\n- Change Vine gRPC binding from IPv6 [::1] to IPv4 127.0.0.1\n- Add startup extension activation trigger ($activateByEvent(\"*\")) after Cocoon handshake\n- Add get_static_application_root() helper for Sky Target path access\n- Increase Cocoon connection retry intervals and add delay for race condition prevention\n- Update Tauri CSP to include vscode-file: protocol in connect-src\n- Fix README.md: correct Tauri badge image URL and NLnet URL casing",
			"SHA": "b27a154a2b2fa0f559a524c6abba1dc6d5cafe40"
		},
